{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdngAGSLDg8F88wYwX4XN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"dispositions\":[{\"atoms\":[],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00590_b595fccb3da1\",\"kind\":\"review_required\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00592_735ea3a8211b\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_definition\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Every Queue entry has a defined result, a related Role, a material requirement where appropriate, and a required quantity of committed Role labor.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Every Queue entry has a defined result, a related Role, a material requirement where appropriate, and a required quantity of committed Role labor.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00592-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00592_735ea3a8211b\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00594_574257a471e3\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"While a Citizen services the Project Queue, their Role Capacity is committed to that entry.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"While a Citizen services the Project Queue, their Role Capacity is committed to that entry.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00594-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00594_574257a471e3\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00596_985951b83725\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"That Capacity does not simultaneously provide the Role’s ordinary passive function.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"The Citizen's committed Role Capacity does not simultaneously provide the Role's ordinary passive function.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00596-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00596_985951b83725\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00598_19d868a74e89\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"If several Citizens provide the same Role, only committed Capacity is suspended.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"If several Citizens provide the same Role, only committed Capacity is suspended.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00598-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00598_19d868a74e89\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Uncommitted Capacity continues ordinary coverage.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Uncommitted Capacity continues ordinary coverage.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00598-P2\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00598_19d868a74e89\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00600_f99146185bbd\",\"claim_kind\":\"design_principle\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A Citizen may maintain the Colony’s ordinary function or deliberately change what the Colony can do. They do not perform both with the same civic share.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Citizen may maintain the Colony's ordinary function or deliberately change what the Colony can do, but does not perform both with the same civic share.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00600-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00600_f99146185bbd\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00602_aabd7eec54e2\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A Project is enacted through the Project Queue by its related Role.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Project is enacted through the Project Queue by its related Role.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00602-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00602_aabd7eec54e2\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00604_2a51f4a97320\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"The related Role is determined by the Project’s principal civic function, not simply by whether material is moved.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"The related Role is determined by the Project's principal civic function, not simply by whether material is moved.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00604-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00604_2a51f4a97320\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00606_84be1ff715f3\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_example\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A Gardener therefore enacts a Winter Cultivation adaptation even when the Project consumes Scrap.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Gardener therefore enacts a Winter Cultivation adaptation even when the Project consumes Scrap.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00606-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00606_84be1ff715f3\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00608_f4c9a97eef20\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A developmental MEET does not instantly upgrade a Place.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A developmental MEET does not instantly upgrade a Place.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00608-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00608_f4c9a97eef20\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00612_e1b640519bde\",\"claim_kind\":\"process_sequence\",\"exact_source_text\":\"World experience → developmental threshold → Home MEET → Practice or decision → Project Queue entry → completed Place function\",\"normalized_claim\":\"The development sequence is: world experience, then developmental threshold, then Home MEET, then Practice or decision, then Project Queue entry, then completed Place function.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00612-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00612_e1b640519bde\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00614_21df4d66370b\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Tools are produced through the same Project Queue.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Tools are produced through the same Project Queue.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00614-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00614_21df4d66370b\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00616_0610c09bb85f\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Each Tool class has a simple Scrap recipe.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Each Tool class has a simple Scrap recipe.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00616-P1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001__B00616_0610c09bb85f\",\"claim_kind\":\"mechanic_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A Tool entry is serviced by a Crafter.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Tool entry is serviced by a Crafter.\",\"proposal_id\":\"B00616-P2\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-047-DEVELOPMENT-RULINGS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"b